WEBVTT

44:33.739 --> 44:36.033
I hit him.

44:36.158 --> 44:37.493
I hit the dragon.

44:37.618 --> 44:39.912
Your brother Rhaegar
was the last dragon.

44:40.037 --> 44:42.581
Viserys is less than
the shadow of a snake.

44:42.706 --> 44:46.835
- He is still the true king.
- The truth now.

44:46.961 --> 44:50.923
Do you want to see your brother
sitting on the Iron Throne?

44:51.048 --> 44:52.466
No.

44:53.217 --> 44:55.594
But the common people
are waiting for him.

44:55.719 --> 45:00.015
Illyrio said they are sewing dragon banners
and praying for his return.
